{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
One day I [G]ventured in love never once suspecting what the [C]final result would [G]be.
Now I [G]live in fear of waking up each morning,and [A]finding that youre gone from [D]me.
There's an [G]aching pain in my heart for the name of the [C]one that I hated to [G]face,
Someone [G]else came out to win her, and I came [D]out in second [G]place.[C][G]
{end_of_verse}

